1
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,240
(This story is entirely fictional)

2
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:11,540
(The computer shows a copy history.
What is she afraid of?)

3
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:12,840
(Who's she trying to protect? Jin Keke.)

4
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:14,320
(Wen saw it.
She couldn't pretend not to.)

5
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:16,240
(What she brought back; A USB drive
was tampered. The files were copied.)

6
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:35,480
(Based on the novel
Doctor Qin: Executer)

7
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:30,000
(No!)

8
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:29,320
=Doctor Qin: Executer=
=Episode 25=

9
00:02:39,720 --> 00:02:44,080
(In Loving Memory
of My Daughter, Xia Wen)

10
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:49,039
Stop crying!

11
00:02:49,719 --> 00:02:50,759
What good is crying?

12
00:02:50,879 --> 00:02:52,599
Will crying bring Xia Wen back?

13
00:02:53,199 --> 00:02:54,080
I'm sorry...

14
00:02:55,759 --> 00:02:56,800
I'm sorry...

15
00:02:58,159 --> 00:03:01,919
What exactly happened that night?

16
00:03:03,520 --> 00:03:04,319
(Of course,)

17
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:07,560
(Back then, she didn't have the courage
to confess)

18
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:09,759
(what happened that night.)

19
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:11,120
(Whatever,)

20
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:14,759
(Le Tianyi and Zhang Xiaodong
started it all.)

21
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:18,319
(I'll make them die miserably.)

22
00:03:29,319 --> 00:03:30,120
Keke,

23
00:03:30,479 --> 00:03:32,840
I cry holding the photo album every day.

24
00:03:33,319 --> 00:03:34,879
You think I'm losing my mind?

25
00:03:36,039 --> 00:03:36,840
No.

26
00:03:37,840 --> 00:03:40,479
Every day, I live in misery, wide awake.

27
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:42,520
Every day I remind myself

28
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,800
not to forget.

29
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:58,759
(Photos and notes)

30
00:03:58,759 --> 00:04:01,280
Xia Wen didn't know
how wicked people can be,

31
00:04:01,879 --> 00:04:03,199
so she died.

32
00:04:04,039 --> 00:04:06,800
But you crawled out of darkness.

33
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:09,960
You've tasted betrayal and despair.

34
00:04:10,199 --> 00:04:12,319
So you understand darkness better.

35
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:15,039
Are you still

36
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:17,680
the Jin Keke in the abyss,

37
00:04:18,199 --> 00:04:20,480
manipulated by bad buys?

38
00:04:24,639 --> 00:04:25,439
Remember.

39
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:28,720
That crying, weak Jin Keke

40
00:04:28,839 --> 00:04:31,120
already died with Xia Wen!

41
00:04:31,279 --> 00:04:32,759
The person you've become

42
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:35,800
is someone carrying Xia Wen's resentment

43
00:04:35,879 --> 00:04:40,079
and all of Jin Keke's pain,
the Executer.

44
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:47,040
Are you ready?

45
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:00,879
I'm ready.

46
00:05:29,639 --> 00:05:32,360
Keke, what is this place?

47
00:05:34,519 --> 00:05:35,879
A place where no one disturbs us

48
00:05:36,079 --> 00:05:37,600
to settle old scores.

49
00:06:59,279 --> 00:07:01,240
(She rented this place with money)

50
00:07:01,279 --> 00:07:02,720
(extorted from the bosses.)

51
00:07:03,079 --> 00:07:05,639
(Her drive exceeded my expectations.)

52
00:07:06,639 --> 00:07:09,639
(Maybe she's been like me
all these years,)

53
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:13,560
(thinking about how to take revenge
every moment.)

54
00:07:27,079 --> 00:07:27,879
Keke.

55
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:35,079
I probably won't hold on much longer.

56
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:38,199
Mom, what nonsense?

57
00:07:46,759 --> 00:07:47,720
The doctor said

58
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:50,000
(Discharge diagnosis)
maybe in a year or two,

59
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:50,560
(Alzheimer's)

60
00:07:50,639 --> 00:07:52,399
I might not remember anything.

61
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:55,600
I won't remember Wen's face,

62
00:07:56,959 --> 00:07:59,079
or how she died.

63
00:08:00,079 --> 00:08:02,360
I won't even remember the names

64
00:08:02,360 --> 00:08:03,600
of our enemies.

65
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:08,240
I'm afraid after I go down there,

66
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:10,279
Wen will ask me.

67
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:12,360
Mom,

68
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:15,360
did you avenge me?

69
00:08:17,959 --> 00:08:20,720
But I don't even remember those enemies.

70
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:24,480
Keke.

71
00:08:26,199 --> 00:08:27,800
While I still remember,

72
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:30,800
let's do it now, okay?

73
00:08:32,559 --> 00:08:34,360
I don't want to leave with regrets.

74
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:39,519
Keke.

75
00:08:41,399 --> 00:08:42,919
Promise me, okay?

76
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:51,039
Okay.

77
00:08:55,080 --> 00:08:56,080
I promise you.

78
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:11,200
If you don't let me out,

79
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,759
I won't take a single sip!

80
00:09:13,519 --> 00:09:14,519
Let me go!

81
00:09:31,879 --> 00:09:35,279
(I know, but what can I do?)

82
00:09:36,159 --> 00:09:39,799
(I hate her,
but I can't live without her.)

83
00:10:04,639 --> 00:10:05,840
You wretch!

84
00:10:07,960 --> 00:10:08,960
Let me out!

85
00:10:09,480 --> 00:10:10,759
Let me out!

86
00:10:15,159 --> 00:10:18,000
The person in the cage
is also the one who built it.

87
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:19,799
She imprisoned souls,

88
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:22,879
only to be consumed by hunger.

89
00:10:24,159 --> 00:10:24,799
Listen,

90
00:10:25,919 --> 00:10:27,879
