91
00:10:28,760 --> 00:10:31,279
They're licking an impure heart.

92
00:10:33,440 --> 00:10:34,759
This is the first judgment

93
00:10:35,279 --> 00:10:36,679
and also a declaration.

94
00:10:37,440 --> 00:10:38,759
Retribution has come.

95
00:10:39,639 --> 00:10:43,039
Every sin will be paid for.

96
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:03,000
Mom.

97
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:05,720
They believed what I said.

98
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:06,960
Don't call me Mom!

99
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:10,679
I never treated you as my daughter.

100
00:11:13,039 --> 00:11:13,840
Mom...

101
00:11:15,279 --> 00:11:16,080
What's wrong?

102
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:19,240
I haven't done enough?

103
00:11:20,399 --> 00:11:21,200
Mom...

104
00:11:22,679 --> 00:11:25,120
Mom, what else do I have to do?

105
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,200
Tell me.

106
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:27,919
I'm not your mom!

107
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:30,559
And you were never my daughter!

108
00:11:31,399 --> 00:11:32,200
Mom...

109
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:36,279
Mom...

110
00:11:38,399 --> 00:11:39,200
Mom...

111
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,960
Are you abandoning me?

112
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:46,360
Who'd truly love someone

113
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:49,240
