114
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:49,919
Mom!

115
00:11:50,360 --> 00:11:51,879
She choked me!

116
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:04,879
I didn't mean to...

117
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:11,759
I didn't mean to...

118
00:12:12,759 --> 00:12:14,200
I didn't mean to...

119
00:12:34,840 --> 00:12:36,600
After Jin Keke met with the lawyer,

120
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:38,320
she was like a soulless shell.

121
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:39,639
Look.

122
00:12:42,640 --> 00:12:44,440
(Interrogation Room)
When is my mom coming to see me?

123
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:45,759
Ms. Song wanted me to tell you

124
00:12:45,759 --> 00:12:47,080
she doesn't want to see you ever again.

125
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:48,399
She never treated you as her daughter.

126
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:49,919
Why?

127
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:54,200
Tell me!

128
00:12:54,600 --> 00:12:55,519
Why?

129
00:12:57,720 --> 00:12:58,919
Tell her to come see me.

130
00:12:59,159 --> 00:13:00,679
Tell her to come see me!

131
00:13:02,919 --> 00:13:03,919
Don't touch me!

132
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:06,559
Jin Keke, watch your attitude!

133
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:20,240
Keke.

134
00:13:21,279 --> 00:13:23,039
Haven't you ever felt

135
00:13:24,200 --> 00:13:25,559
she's using you?

136
00:13:29,840 --> 00:13:31,080
Some things

137
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:36,159
are too painful to know.

138
00:13:37,879 --> 00:13:41,799
Just let me live in the story I chose.

139
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:54,519
"Jin Keke is very smart and obedient.

140
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:56,480
So in the police's eyes,

141
00:13:57,000 --> 00:13:59,080
