without time to commit the crimes.

142
00:14:00,759 --> 00:14:04,879
The real killer was always me."

143
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:06,840
(And I'm just an old woman)

144
00:14:06,840 --> 00:14:10,039
(with Alzheimer's
who lost her only child.)

145
00:14:10,279 --> 00:14:12,600
(This plan isn't flawless,)

146
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:14,399
(but at least it can stall)

147
00:14:14,399 --> 00:14:16,799
(until we can finish everything.)

148
00:14:20,240 --> 00:14:22,720
♪Happy birthday to you♪

149
00:14:23,159 --> 00:14:26,159
♪Happy birthday to you♪

150
00:14:26,840 --> 00:14:30,559
♪Happy birthday to you♪

151
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:33,679
♪Happy birthday to you♪

152
00:15:04,080 --> 00:15:04,879
Keke.

153
00:15:06,759 --> 00:15:09,679
What exactly did Le Tianyi do to Wen?

154
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:14,759
Wen, she...

155
