185
00:17:43,480 --> 00:17:45,880
Listen to me. It was an accident.

186
00:17:47,240 --> 00:17:48,519
I didn't kill her.

187
00:17:49,839 --> 00:17:51,160
I didn't kill her.

188
00:17:51,519 --> 00:17:52,400
It wasn't me.

189
00:17:53,799 --> 00:17:55,160
I didn't kill her!

190
00:17:55,279 --> 00:17:57,160
I didn't kill her!

191
00:17:57,359 --> 00:17:58,880
Let me go!

192
00:17:59,240 --> 00:18:01,200
I have kids too.

193
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:02,240
I also...

194
00:18:02,240 --> 00:18:04,480
