196
00:18:26,799 --> 00:18:27,799
It wasn't me...

197
00:18:31,200 --> 00:18:33,039
Pigs eat anything.

198
00:18:34,079 --> 00:18:38,359
Dirty, rotten, abandoned things.

199
00:18:39,000 --> 00:18:40,680
