200
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:47,799
Today the pigs will eat you!

201
00:18:48,680 --> 00:18:50,240
That's what your sins deserve!

202
00:18:52,640 --> 00:18:54,640
Wake up, Le Tianyi...

203
00:18:54,880 --> 00:18:56,319
Wake up...

204
00:18:59,079 --> 00:19:02,160
The Executer is never absent.

205
00:19:04,160 --> 00:19:04,880
What is all this?

206
00:19:05,599 --> 00:19:06,319
Help!

207
00:19:07,319 --> 00:19:10,880
- Hypocrites nest atop the tower.
- Help!

208
00:19:11,759 --> 00:19:13,799
- Grinding her struggles into stairs.
- Save me!

209
00:19:14,359 --> 00:19:16,359
Boiling her tears into soup.

210
00:19:16,599 --> 00:19:17,640
This man

211
00:19:18,240 --> 00:19:20,640
